    "title": "Downtown Marquette Ringing In 2026 With Ball Drop Event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jack Hall ,\n5 hours ago Ring in the New Year at the NYE Ball Drop Bash, presented by Double Trouble Entertainment, happening tonight on the 100 block of W. Washington Street!. Returning this year is the family-friendly ball drop at 8:00 PM, giving kids a chance to celebrate without staying up until midnight. Then the midnight ball drop festivities begin at 11:00 PM to ring in the new year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
